  m_text: In this exciting logic game, you have to guide the ball to the finish line,
    overcoming various obstacles. On your way, you will encounter stones and other
    balls that can hinder your movement. To move forward, you need to strategically
    select two balls and swap them, creating a free path to the finish line. Use
    your wits and plan your moves in advance to successfully complete all levels
    and reach the goal. Are you ready to test your skills? Go for the win!
